                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "extract",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f909efa-b6b6-3412-bad7-c4fbddf9edf2",
                                        "entry_id": "b36fbcce-67ec-3e54-8b5a-dd70a0f42b1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To draw out; to pull out; to remove forcibly from a fixed position, as by traction or suction, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "741d1b42-ae84-4371-b71c-3b669fa2d0dd",
                                                "sense_id": "6f909efa-b6b6-3412-bad7-c4fbddf9edf2",
                                                "text": "to extract a tooth from its socket, a stump from the earth, or a splinter from the finger"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3bd8561-b5af-4198-8365-d99bebfd92b3",
                                                "sense_id": "6f909efa-b6b6-3412-bad7-c4fbddf9edf2",
                                                "text": "The bee / Sits on the bloom extracting liquid sweet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73724271-2d0d-4a6a-a937-f4ba9708dc95",
                                                "sense_id": "6f909efa-b6b6-3412-bad7-c4fbddf9edf2",
                                                "text": "The dawn of the oil age was fairly recent. Although the stuff was used to waterproof boats in the Middle East 6,000 years ago, extracting it in earnest began only in 1859 after an oil strike in Pennsylvania. The first barrels of crude fetched $18 (around $450 at today’s prices)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd80472a-2e3c-4a4e-8c17-92698f18fd60",
                                                "sense_id": "6f909efa-b6b6-3412-bad7-c4fbddf9edf2",
                                                "text": "There is, in fact, growing recognition in the Department that giving free rein to the open access operators will extract revenue from Great British Railways."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5334c429-4ed4-338e-9d52-cab5540a771e",
                                        "entry_id": "b36fbcce-67ec-3e54-8b5a-dd70a0f42b1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To withdraw by squeezing, distillation, or other mechanical or chemical process. Compare abstract (transitive verb)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a18c5a-cad9-4288-87ae-a27cf36b3274",
                                                "sense_id": "5334c429-4ed4-338e-9d52-cab5540a771e",
                                                "text": "to extract an essential oil from a plant"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac83f6b1-0c87-47a8-9aa4-83053a2a1b36",
                                                "sense_id": "5334c429-4ed4-338e-9d52-cab5540a771e",
                                                "text": "Mostly, the microbiome is beneficial. It helps with digestion and enables people to extract a lot more calories from their food than would otherwise be possible. Research over the past few years, however, has implicated it in diseases from atherosclerosis to asthma to autism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c53d1783-f858-3b68-952b-af06d8949ec6",
                                        "entry_id": "b36fbcce-67ec-3e54-8b5a-dd70a0f42b1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To choose out; to cite or quote, for example a passage from a text."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1da4c68-2252-42dd-ab89-e26931ff29d6",
                                                "sense_id": "c53d1783-f858-3b68-952b-af06d8949ec6",
                                                "text": "I have thought it proper to extract out of that pamphlet a few of those notorious falsehoods."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28b26702-e49a-47a4-b2b9-c84b37463f8c",
                                                "sense_id": "c53d1783-f858-3b68-952b-af06d8949ec6",
                                                "text": "As his work is probably not easily accessible to many of my readers, I shall perhaps consult their convenience by extracting his description entire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c64dfcfe-3c0c-353f-b113-26d349f7fe66",
                                        "entry_id": "b36fbcce-67ec-3e54-8b5a-dd70a0f42b1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To select parts of a whole"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18590d7b-1d9d-445a-9292-d754b789e77d",
                                                "sense_id": "c64dfcfe-3c0c-353f-b113-26d349f7fe66",
                                                "text": "We need to try to extract the positives from the defeat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b9c36e1-cda3-3198-bc81-3f8c3747f3ef",
                                        "entry_id": "b36fbcce-67ec-3e54-8b5a-dd70a0f42b1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To determine (a root of a number)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "449848bf-004a-4262-9a74-3f9c8a8078e5",
                                                "sense_id": "7b9c36e1-cda3-3198-bc81-3f8c3747f3ef",
                                                "text": "Please extract the cube root of 27."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "136eb829-b65c-4eed-b476-92295e92c326",
                                                "sense_id": "7b9c36e1-cda3-3198-bc81-3f8c3747f3ef",
                                                "text": "[…] Mr. Nackybal was thoroughly examined, both in cubing and extracting, from the table that Louit had provided."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "33785039-49aa-477c-b385-7b3dc4574200",
                        "source_entry_id": "6656c208-3edf-3c1b-a492-f182b1e36898",
                        "source_sense_id": "97bf9e1e-71d1-3b0c-be0b-9df02e2f72a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "decoction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "decoction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "056f2ac6-ca1a-3acd-8db3-cc25e4a1973d",
                                        "entry_id": "9f06d297-7c74-33b3-be41-5f6c2293ea37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extraction or essence of something, obtained by boiling it down."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03ee588f-bf36-4809-81a0-1ed7a44093dc",
                                                "sense_id": "056f2ac6-ca1a-3acd-8db3-cc25e4a1973d",
                                                "text": "[I]nſtead of Honey, Rob of Elder, Conſerve of Roſes, or Syrup of Violets; Glyſters, Pedilavia of emollient Decoctions with Nitre; or Elder, Vinegar, or Focus's of the ſame, applied with Sponges behind the Ears, to the Armpits, Groins, Hams, &c. or with Barley-water and a little Roſe-vinegar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "682790e9-d0f3-4942-86ce-502762c669dc",
                                                "sense_id": "056f2ac6-ca1a-3acd-8db3-cc25e4a1973d",
                                                "text": "The transition is a keen one, I assure you, from a schoolmaster to a sailor, and requires a strong decoction of Seneca and the Stoics to enable you to grin and bear it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e6e968e-b067-4192-8249-23e9d004a2ba",
                                                "sense_id": "056f2ac6-ca1a-3acd-8db3-cc25e4a1973d",
                                                "text": "Poley offered a hot decoction of blackberries, saying: Peace?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d736efcb-36e0-4458-9102-b7e16dad44a0",
                                                "sense_id": "056f2ac6-ca1a-3acd-8db3-cc25e4a1973d",
                                                "text": "Witches and devils no longer threaten you and me. We don’t mind living next door to the harmless lady with her herb garden and decoction still, her black cat and red hair."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f14f395-4f81-3f9e-a020-e0e9590c0927",
                                        "entry_id": "9f06d297-7c74-33b3-be41-5f6c2293ea37",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of boiling something down in this way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faccb30c-82dc-41e6-85e9-c1287d0adea1",
                                                "sense_id": "9f14f395-4f81-3f9e-a020-e0e9590c0927",
                                                "text": "Even the fixed principles of vegetables, at least some of them, are injured by long decoction. The extractive matter, for instance, gradually absorbs oxygen from the atmosphere, and is converted into a substance nearly insipid and inert."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60286b9c-6d89-4a55-a901-fb42f7ff57d5",
                        "source_entry_id": "6656c208-3edf-3c1b-a492-f182b1e36898",
                        "source_sense_id": "97bf9e1e-71d1-3b0c-be0b-9df02e2f72a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "tisane",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tisane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b314e4a6-f383-3d9a-bdaa-bf5e90884afa",
                                        "entry_id": "b99bb29f-85ec-383d-abc3-d9aa1a21b944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Boisson obtenue par infusion, macération ou décoction de plantes sèches, généralement avec des vertus médicamenteuses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b348a90-9fac-4e37-b80a-ab4cc3753992",
                                                "sense_id": "b314e4a6-f383-3d9a-bdaa-bf5e90884afa",
                                                "text": "Une tasse de tisane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73705296-f64a-40e4-b899-dd654a82fb0e",
                                                "sense_id": "b314e4a6-f383-3d9a-bdaa-bf5e90884afa",
                                                "text": "On lui fit boire quelques tasses de tisane rafraîchissante, dont la pharmacie végétale de Granite-house fournit les ingrédients."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67c6a4a4-3078-4d9e-b650-0bb9bedad389",
                                                "sense_id": "b314e4a6-f383-3d9a-bdaa-bf5e90884afa",
                                                "text": "Elle avait beau avaler des boules de gomme et des pâtes, s’ingurgiter des tisanes de mauve et des quatre-fleurs, des sirops calmants et des loochs, la toux ne s’en allait point."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ff2aaba-a4f1-4b65-ad35-d5f96c095506",
                                                "sense_id": "b314e4a6-f383-3d9a-bdaa-bf5e90884afa",
                                                "text": "La semaine suivante, Mme la directrice l’invita à venir boire chez elle une tisane anglaise qu’on appelait du thé."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7ac1a73-e300-3b77-916f-f39a8a9c9f69",
                                        "entry_id": "b99bb29f-85ec-383d-abc3-d9aa1a21b944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Paroles douçâtres, consolations lénifiantes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01f227ff-f2f1-48c3-b55e-3df716c4e8d3",
                                                "sense_id": "d7ac1a73-e300-3b77-916f-f39a8a9c9f69",
                                                "text": "Son tourment profond n’avait que faire de ces tisanes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9787068d-5fbe-39ca-9357-f64b0cb61e9f",
                                        "entry_id": "b99bb29f-85ec-383d-abc3-d9aa1a21b944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Essence, carburant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b7d66d-bf75-4287-8318-0fc641c3d81b",
                                                "sense_id": "9787068d-5fbe-39ca-9357-f64b0cb61e9f",
                                                "text": "On a pu franchir quelque vingt mille bornes en si peu de temps avec si peu de tisane ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bb47ec9-2ab7-3c4b-a044-fb12731105f9",
                                        "entry_id": "b99bb29f-85ec-383d-abc3-d9aa1a21b944",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Raclée, correction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "795e36b8-101f-4875-9c3c-a0e7ead3f2d3",
                                                "sense_id": "9bb47ec9-2ab7-3c4b-a044-fb12731105f9",
                                                "text": "La première tisane sérieuse que je me suis laissé aller, c’est avec le fils Rocca, un merdeux qu’habitait au 5 de la rue, juste à côté du 3."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60f0515a-5031-43e0-b19e-07b10f354ec0",
                                                "sense_id": "9bb47ec9-2ab7-3c4b-a044-fb12731105f9",
                                                "text": "J’arrive juste à temps pour voir relever l’Ukrainien, cette fois pâle comme une assiette. Toly, à peine essoufflé, me raconte en concluant : « Je lui ai foutu une tisane devant ses copains, il va être vexé, ça lui apprendra. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
